&lt;h2 class="crayons-story__title crayons-story__title-full_post"&gt;
&lt;a href="https://dev.to/lovestaco/cheap-rag-in-go-with-gemini-file-search-no-vector-db-two-calls-one-hosted-store-4kb5" id="article-link-4710440"&gt;
Cheap RAG in Go with Gemini File Search: no vector DB, two calls, one hosted store
&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class="crayons-story__tags"&gt;
